{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LfAkEECJ2g1794361445.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>受東北季候風影響，今早市區氣溫降至約18度，新界部分地區降至12度以下，打鼓嶺最低10.4度。</p><p></p><p>在九龍塘返工返學的市民，都有穿著長袖衫或外套。天文台預測今日天晴乾燥，日間最高氣溫約25度。</p><p></p><p>東北季候風明日繼續影響廣東地區，早上天氣清涼，日夜溫差頗大。本周後期氣溫回升，周五及周六最高27度，有幾陣驟雨，周日最高28度。而另一股東北季候風，會在下周中期影響廣東。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T02:51:00.148455+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T01:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T16:14:26.704879+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T02:44:21.999502+00:00","content_hash":"fc87a551a0f10c0cc3032f8fd798e6fa9880d0eb018e8129f76966937998ddaf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T02:51:00.148455+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}